{"sections":[{"slug":"超平面丛","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"超平面丛"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">超平面丛</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“超平面丛”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/射影空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">射影空间</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathbb{P}^n(\\mathbb{C})$ <span lang=\"zh\">的超平面</span> $H$ <span lang=\"zh\">对应的线丛仍记为</span> $H$, <span lang=\"zh\">其</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Hermite向量丛","text":"Hermite <span lang=\"zh\">向量丛</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">结构由</span>\n$$\r\nh = \\frac{1}{1+|t^1|^2+\\cdots+ |t^n|^2}\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">给出</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">第一</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/陈类","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">陈类</span>"}},{"Plain":"\n$$c_1(H,h)= - \\sqrt{-1}\\partial \\bar\\partial \\log h$$</p>\n"}]}}}]}